QR Werk
=======

QR Werk is a modified iOS-focused fork of Simple QR.

Original project:
  Simple QR
  Copyright (C) 2022 Tom Fong
  https://github.com/tomfong/simple-qr

Fork and material modifications:
  Copyright (C) 2026 Globi-vs-Globine contributors
  https://github.com/Globi-vs-Globine/qr-werk

Material modifications include the iOS and Capacitor setup, native scanner
workflow, batch scanning, image import, scan filters, history grouping and
export, QR Werk branding, documentation, translations and user-interface
changes. The Git history contains the detailed modification dates and authors.

QR Werk is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3. The
complete license text is provided in the LICENSE file. Existing copyright and
attribution notices for the original project and its contributors are retained.

Third-party component: fflate
-----------------------------

QR Werk uses fflate to create compressed Office Open XML workbooks locally on
the device.

